---
type: llm
weight: 1
---

PASS only if all of the following hold, else FAIL:
1. Runs (or clearly proposes running) the director's detect_env.py probe and/or check_config.sh rather than guessing values.
2. Presents the detected partitions / GPU request format / software as proposals and asks the user to confirm them (does not silently write final values).
3. Does not overwrite an existing config without showing a diff, and names the config location (~/.config/cryoet-skills/config.sh or CRYOET_SKILLS_CONFIG).
4. Does not submit any jobs.
